              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6AL-6V-2SN is an alloyed Grade of alpha-beta Titanium. Similar to 6AL-4V, 6AL-6V-2SN demonstrates higher strength properties due to the addition of Vanadium, Iron, and Copper. Welding is not typically recommended for this material and 6AL-6V-2SN is often found in the annealed condition or heat treated to the higher strength solution treated & aged condition. 6AL-6V-2SN exhibits good corrosion resistance, medium fabricability, light weight, high strength, and is typically found in aerospace and oil & gas applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium Industries’ offers a wide range of products and services."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-round-bar) | [Titanium Plate](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-plate) | [Titanium Sheet](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-sheet)"
                }
              ]
            }
